#: pwmanager/pwm.cpp:538
msgid ""
"An entry with this \"Description\", already exists;\n"
"please select another description."
msgstr ""
"यो \"Description\" सँग द्रष्टव्य, पहिले नै अवस्थित छ;\n"
"कृपया अर्को वर्णन चयन गर्नुहोस।"

